{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"马里","country_iso":"MLI","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:01:28.854361","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MLI-HB-0002","ldc":"Yes","location":"巴马科市郊的萨福镇","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马里萨福光伏储能电站Ⅰ期项目","project_name_en":"Mali Safu Solar PV and Energy Storage Station Phase I Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中国水电十六局","content":"日前，水电十六局与电建江西院组成联营体以水电国际品牌成功签约马里萨福光伏储能电站Ⅰ期项目。\n马里萨福光伏储能电站Ⅰ期项目位于马里首都巴马科市郊的萨福镇，工期12个月，工程主要内容包括设计、建造、供应及安装一个50MW太阳能发电厂、25MWh光伏储存系统、一条10KM长的进场道路以及其他相关附属能源设施。\n作为马里首批建设的太阳能发电站之一，萨福光伏储能电站项目建成后将具备每年为马里首都巴马科供电87,264.72MWh的能力，对马里改善电力供应状况，助力经济社会发展意义重大。","content_sha256":"f818e2d0909694600229db478f8894f874eb8c5e9d91e7de811775dfb7a9504e","id":5253,"publish_date":"2024-12-28 09:14:06","title":"水电十六局与电建江西院联营签约马里萨福光伏储能电站Ⅰ期项目","title_sha256":"1a25ffa0d3d690f805bed1bdbfbe5484eae6324514af23dbf447193062a914ab","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/76843.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MLI-HB-0002","capacity_details":"PV: 50MW, BESS: 25MWh","capacity_mw":50.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"50","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:01:28.854694","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MLI-HB-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.powerchina.cn/col7449/art/2024/art_7449_2056014.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"水电十六局与电建江西院联营体","project_developer_en":"HydroChina Sixteen with PowerChina Jiangxi Institute Consortium","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"水电十六局与电建江西院组成的联营体在马里签约了萨福光伏储能电站Ⅰ期